nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay=Icon Name Overlay
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.tip=Configure names displayed on item and fluid icons.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.mode=Display Name on Icons
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.mode.0=Items Only
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.mode.1=Fluids Only
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.mode.2=Shown
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.mode.3=Hidden
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.mode.tip=Choose which icons display names. Hover over an icon to see its full name.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.fontScale=Font Scale
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.fontScale.tip=Preferred size for ordinary fonts. 1.0 is normal size; names may shrink to fit.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.unicodeFontScale=Unicode Font Scale
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.unicodeFontScale.tip=Preferred size for Unicode fonts and text, including Chinese characters. 1.0 is normal size.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.minimumScale=Minimum Font Scale
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.minimumScale.tip=Lower bound when shrinking names. This takes priority if it exceeds a preferred font scale.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.width=Label Width
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.width.tip=Total label width in pixels, centered on each icon. Larger values can overlap neighboring icons.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.maxCharacters=Maximum Characters per Line
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.maxCharacters.tip=0 = automatic. Limits Unicode characters per line, including any ellipsis.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.maxLines=Maximum Lines
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.maxLines.tip=1 disables wrapping. The available height and minimum scale can reduce the actual number of lines.
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.outline=Text Outline
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.outline.true=Shown
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.outline.false=Hidden
nei.options.inventory.itemNameOverlay.outline.tip=Draw a one-screen-pixel black outline to keep names readable against the icon.
